    "id": "p5-q69-response",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "69",
    "prompt": "Simplify the following.\n$$\\frac{2a^5b^3}{3a^2b^5}\\times\\frac{5a^7}{4b^2}$$",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\dfrac{5a^{10}}{6b^4}$, $a,b\\ne0$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{2a^5b^3}{3a^2b^5}\\times\\frac{5a^7}{4b^2}&=\\frac{10}{12}a^{5+7-2}b^{3-5-2}\\\\\\frac{2a^5b^3}{3a^2b^5}\\times\\frac{5a^7}{4b^2}&=\\frac56a^{10}b^{-4}\\\\\\frac{2a^5b^3}{3a^2b^5}\\times\\frac{5a^7}{4b^2}&=\\frac{5a^{10}}{6b^4}\\end{align*}$$\nThe original denominators require $a,b\\ne0$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 28
  },
